  "steps": [
   {
    "text": "[Choose File] (one call, like the Planning Order upload): create UPLOAD_ID (sequence) and insert TB_R_MILEAGE_UPLOAD_LOG with STATUS 'PROCESSING', FILE_NAME, START_DT; log message no. 1.",
    "children": [
     "Lock: the user has another upload in PROCESSING: log message no. 2. Stop."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "File check before any data row is stored: extension .xlsx / .xls, readable; sheet with the header row containing FROM CODE (title rows above allowed); columns FROM CODE, TO CODE, MILEAGE (KM) present (other columns ignored); 1 to 1,000 data rows (empty rows skipped)."
   },
   {
    "text": "Decision: file OK?",
    "children": [
     "log message no. 3 / log message no. 4 / log message no. 5 / log message no. 6: log STATUS 'ERROR' with MESSAGE, END_DT; stop (nothing in temp)."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Insert every data row into TB_T_MILEAGE_UPLOAD as text with UPLOAD_ID and the Excel ROW_NO; VALIDATION_STATUS 'N'."
   },
   {
    "text": "Validate every row and collect all its errors (Functional Description 4.2): format / mandatory -> Master Location (active) -> From <> To -> Mileage > 0, 2 decimals -> duplicate route in the file -> existing route (Inactive = error; Active same mileage = SAME; other mileage = UPDATE; none = NEW).",
    "children": [
     "Each failed row: log message no. 7; temp VALIDATION_STATUS 'E', ERROR_COLUMN, ERROR_MSG, ACTION 'ERROR'. Valid rows: 'V' with ACTION."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Update TB_R_MILEAGE_UPLOAD_LOG counts. Decision: any error or nothing to save?",
    "children": [
     "Errors: STATUS 'ERROR', END_DT, log message no. 8; return the error list (ROW_NO, ERROR_COLUMN, ERROR_MSG) for the modal 'Upload validation failed'. Stop, nothing saved.",
     "All SAME: STATUS 'ERROR', log message no. 9. Stop."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "No error: BEGIN TRANSACTION in the same call (no preview / confirm step); read the routes of the file again with UPDLOCK so the result of step 5 is still valid."
   },
   {
    "text": "INSERT ielp.TB_M_MILEAGE for ACTION 'NEW'; UPDATE ielp.TB_M_MILEAGE for ACTION 'UPDATE' (WHERE route AND VERSION read in step 7); INSERT TB_H_MILEAGE for each update (old / new mileage, proposed); COMMIT (all-or-nothing).",
    "children": [
     "DB error: ROLLBACK, log 'ERROR', log message no. 10."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Update TB_R_MILEAGE_UPLOAD_LOG: STATUS 'SUCCESS', ADDED_ROWS, UPDATED_ROWS, END_DT; delete the temp rows; log message no. 11. Unexpected error at any step: log message no. 12."
   }
  ]
 },
